{"synopsis":"Setelah bereinkarnasi ke dunia fantasi, ia menjadi guru dari Sang Kaisar Wanita sebelum ia beralih ke kegelapan.\n\nMurid kecil yang dulunya sering diperlakukan dengan kejam tiba-tiba menyadari bahwa gurunya kini menjadi lebih lembut, lebih kuat, dan semakin berhati lembut meski ucapannya masih tajam…\n\nSu Changge: “Sialan, sistem, aku tidak mau jadi penjahat brengsek!”\nSistem: “Terlahir sebagai penjahat, takdirnya adalah menjadi antagonis!”\nFeng Wanqing: “Bagaimana jika aku jatuh cinta pada guruku? Aku ingin menjalani kisah cinta manis yang bisa menghancurkan langit dan bumi bersamanya.”","alternative_title":"My Empress Disciple Is About to Turn Dark","author":"九川动漫","artist":"","chapters":[{"number":"72","chapter":"72","slug":"fbeae560-2e3f-470d-815b-dd9d370ab0b9","title":"Chapter 72","date":"2026-07-29"},{"number":"71","chapter":"71","slug":"bdecdb5e-4ad7-4ffe-b27e-c2d121aec8c1","title":"Chapter 71","date":"2026-07-17"},{"number":"70","chapter":"70","slug":"1091d3e8-15bc-4b47-8e75-3e9155a40997","title":"Chapter 70","date":"2026-05-20"},{"number":"69","chapter":"69","slug":"96035d2a-05f4-4c61-91d0-03708163970a","title":"Chapter 69","date":"2026-05-01"},{"number":"68","chapter":"68","slug":"2557071e-fc7c-43e9-bf74-dc08aa283760","title":"Chapter 68","date":"2026-04-30"},{"number":"67","chapter":"67","slug":"1d851916-c42a-4f75-b4af-0b4e40fa3b2e","title":"Chapter 67","date":"2026-04-13"},{"number":"66","chapter":"66","slug":"6203093d-2c3a-443f-bf80-d191872806ad","title":"Chapter 66","date":"2026-03-27"},{"number":"65","chapter":"65","slug":"11ec8e14-1c26-479b-9d3b-490e8820181c","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-03-13"},{"number":"64","chapter":"64","slug":"7a8abec1-cb4f-4854-9f49-35bfcc4328a0","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-03-12"},{"number":"63","chapter":"63","slug":"a13ad7a9-4c23-4ca7-ab40-94d3c615471e","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-02-26"},{"number":"62","chapter":"62","slug":"a018ddcb-e8c2-44f5-a46e-0e18010950dc","title":"Chapter 62","date"